Package: rpMMD
Type: Package
Title: Random-Projection MMD Tests for Multivariate Two-Sample Problems
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(
      given = "Snehashis",
      family = "De",
      email = "snehashisde2000@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Provides an in-progress implementation of random-projection
    maximum mean discrepancy methods for multivariate two-sample problems.
    The package contains utilities for generating random projection directions,
    projecting multivariate samples, computing one-dimensional Gaussian-kernel
    MMD statistics, and building the main testing workflow. The final project
    will add the paper-specific combined test statistics, permutation
    calibration, computational acceleration, documentation, and examples.
